name:Record'AutoCheck
comment:检查是否存在录制,如果没有录制结果那么开启强制保存.然后开启录制@4但结果不一定保存@5
lines:
Dict data=fun map.load()
Bool exist=varf Dict.data.contains(String recList)
if{fun bool.not(var exist)
  Bool Record'ForceSav=fun create.bool(Bool 1)
  act 1101.this.Record'StartRecord()
}
if{fun create.bool(var exist)
  act 1101.this.Record'StartRecord()
}
